# GitHub Linguist & Code Search Controls
# Exclude compiled assets and minified bundles from public GitHub code search results and diffs
assets/* linguist-vendored
assets/* linguist-generated
docs/assets/* linguist-vendored
docs/assets/* linguist-generated
images/* binary

# Treat binary media files properly
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.webm binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary

# Normalize text line endings
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
